{
    "title": "Motorola by Hubble Connected",
    "description": "Welcome to the World of Motorola by Hubble Connected \u2026. Where we empower parents, home owners and expectant mothers to stay connected to what matters most, no matter where they are. \r\n\r\nThe Motorola by Hubble Connected app provides one centralized place to manage all your smart prenatal, baby, nursery and home products from anywhere in the world. Control your Roo, Comfort Cloud, baby monitor, home security camera and more with the touch of a button. \r\n\r\n- SAFE & SECURE \r\nWith advanced end-to-end encryption technology and AES 128-bit streaming, you can rest assured knowing that your baby monitor or home camera stream and other data is totally private and secure. \r\n\r\n- RECORD, STORE & SHARE* \r\nRecord videos and image snapshots and save them using our secure cloud storage. Or easily share them with family and friends. \r\n\r\n- DAILY VIDEO SUMMARY* \r\nGet a quick overview of what went on when you weren\u2019t home. Rewind with a time-lapse Daily Video Summary of the key motion-triggered events from the past 24 hours.  \r\n\r\n- TWO-WAY TALK \r\nSpeak to and hear your loved ones, callers or intruders from anywhere. Sing your little one to sleep with a lullaby, chat to the delivery guy about where to leave your parcel or scare off unwelcome visitors in crystal clear sound through your home camera or baby monitor.  \r\n\r\n- CREATE VIRTUAL BOUNDARIES** \r\nOnly get alerted about the important things with SmartZone. Select specific areas within your camera\u2019s view to receive motion detection notifications for, such as doors, gates and windows.  \r\n\r\n \r\n- VOICE ASSISTANCE \r\nControl your baby monitor, home camera or other voice assistant compatible products hands-free using Amazon Alexa or Google Assistant. Use your voice while multi-tasking to turn on your camera\u2019s recording, ask for the temperature, play a lullaby and more. \r\n\r\n \r\n- BABY TRACKER \r\nBaby Tracker lets you log and track your baby\u2019s development and routines over time, from feeding and sleeping to growth and diaper changes. And when your hands are full, just update the tracker using Amazon Alexa. \r\n\r\n  \r\n- SLEEP & PARENTING TIPS  \r\nAccess articles and videos with sleep and parenting tips from leading childcare organizations. \r\n\r\n- PRENATAL: The Motorola by Hubble Connected app lets Roo Prenatal Heartbeat Monitor users discover a new way to experience the miracle of pregnancy. \r\n\r\n- LISTEN, TRACK & SHARE BABY\u2019S HEARTBEAT \r\nListen to the magical sound of your baby\u2019s heartbeat from the comfort of your home. Save the recordings to cherish the memories forever, and share them with family and friends. \r\n\r\n \r\n- PRENATAL TRACKER \r\nConveniently track important prenatal information with Roo such as your water consumption, weight, bump and baby\u2019s kicks, all in one place.  \r\n\r\n \r\n- VOICE ASSISTANCE \r\nUpdate your prenatal tracker hands-free with Amazon Alexa or Google Assistant. \u201cAlexa, ask Roo to record a kick.\u201d \r\n\r\n \r\n- EXPERT PREGNANCY ADVICE \r\nAccess prenatal tips and advice based on your pregnancy stage. Explore the range of articles and videos, sourced from leading experts.   \r\n\r\n \r\n- PREGNANCY FAQs  \r\nFind answers to the most commonly asked FAQs, from morning sickness and back pain to nutrition and exercise.  \r\n\r\nWe update regularly to include fixes, new features, and performance enhancements. \r\n\r\nMake sure you have Automatic Updates turned on in your app store so you\u2019re always on the latest version. \r\n\r\n*Select features require a Hubble Connected subscription (see https://hubbleconnected.com/plans/ or the app for more details). \r\n\r\n**Available on select home cameras only. Requires a Hubble Connected subscription.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to the World of Motorola by Hubble Connected \u2026. Where we empower parents, home owners and expectant mothers to stay connected to what matters most, no matter where they are. <br><br>The Motorola by Hubble Connected app provides one centralized place to manage all your smart prenatal, baby, nursery and home products from anywhere in the world. Control your Roo, Comfort Cloud, baby monitor, home security camera and more with the touch of a button. <br><br>- SAFE &amp; SECURE <br>With advanced end-to-end encryption technology and AES 128-bit streaming, you can rest assured knowing that your baby monitor or home camera stream and other data is totally private and secure. <br><br>- RECORD, STORE &amp; SHARE* <br>Record videos and image snapshots and save them using our secure cloud storage. Or easily share them with family and friends. <br><br>- DAILY VIDEO SUMMARY* <br>Get a quick overview of what went on when you weren\u2019t home. Rewind with a time-lapse Daily Video Summary of the key motion-triggered events from the past 24 hours.  <br><br>- TWO-WAY TALK <br>Speak to and hear your loved ones, callers or intruders from anywhere. Sing your little one to sleep with a lullaby, chat to the delivery guy about where to leave your parcel or scare off unwelcome visitors in crystal clear sound through your home camera or baby monitor.  <br><br>- CREATE VIRTUAL BOUNDARIES** <br>Only get alerted about the important things with SmartZone. Select specific areas within your camera\u2019s view to receive motion detection notifications for, such as doors, gates and windows.  <br><br> <br>- VOICE ASSISTANCE <br>Control your baby monitor, home camera or other voice assistant compatible products hands-free using Amazon Alexa or Google Assistant. Use your voice while multi-tasking to turn on your camera\u2019s recording, ask for the temperature, play a lullaby and more. <br><br> <br>- BABY TRACKER <br>Baby Tracker lets you log and track your baby\u2019s development and routines over time, from feeding and sleeping to growth and diaper changes. And when your hands are full, just update the tracker using Amazon Alexa. <br><br>  <br>- SLEEP &amp; PARENTING TIPS  <br>Access articles and videos with sleep and parenting tips from leading childcare organizations. <br><br>- PRENATAL: The Motorola by Hubble Connected app lets Roo Prenatal Heartbeat Monitor users discover a new way to experience the miracle of pregnancy. <br><br>- LISTEN, TRACK &amp; SHARE BABY\u2019S HEARTBEAT <br>Listen to the magical sound of your baby\u2019s heartbeat from the comfort of your home. Save the recordings to cherish the memories forever, and share them with family and friends. <br><br> <br>- PRENATAL TRACKER <br>Conveniently track important prenatal information with Roo such as your water consumption, weight, bump and baby\u2019s kicks, all in one place.  <br><br> <br>- VOICE ASSISTANCE <br>Update your prenatal tracker hands-free with Amazon Alexa or Google Assistant. \u201cAlexa, ask Roo to record a kick.\u201d <br><br> <br>- EXPERT PREGNANCY ADVICE <br>Access prenatal tips and advice based on your pregnancy stage. Explore the range of articles and videos, sourced from leading experts.   <br><br> <br>- PREGNANCY FAQs  <br>Find answers to the most commonly asked FAQs, from morning sickness and back pain to nutrition and exercise.  <br><br>We update regularly to include fixes, new features, and performance enhancements. <br><br>Make sure you have Automatic Updates turned on in your app store so you\u2019re always on the latest version. <br><br>*Select features require a Hubble Connected subscription (see https://hubbleconnected.com/plans/ or the app for more details). <br><br>**Available on select home cameras only. Requires a Hubble Connected subscription.",
